cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Induction Period Reader"
abstract: >-
  A single-page browser tool that reads the induction period off a Rancimat
  conductivity trace by fitting the four-parameter kappa response, and reports
  both readings admitted by the standard, the steepest-tangent reading and the
  second-derivative reading, with bootstrap intervals. The fit runs entirely in
  the visitor's browser; nothing is uploaded and nothing is stored.
authors:
